{"kind":"note","note_type":"basic","fields":["On March 9, 1982 his friend led his funeral procession riding a motorcycle and wearing a leather jacket and jeans. Two days later at his memorial service this same friend played the Ventures song 2,000 Pound Bee before 1,000 mourners at the Cathedral of St. John the Divine. Whose epitaph reads I May Be Gone But Rock And Roll Lives On?","John Belushi"],"tags_json":"[\"trivia\",\"people\",\"source:open-trivia-qa\",\"license:cc-by-sa-4.0\"]"}
