{"kind":"note","note_type":"basic","fields":["My nickname was Old Rough and Ready. I served just sixteen months in office in 1849-1850. I was succeeded by Millard Fillmore. Who am I?","Zachary Taylor"],"tags_json":"[\"trivia\",\"people\",\"source:open-trivia-qa\",\"license:cc-by-sa-4.0\"]"}
